		ScalarParameter In_Default_TerminatorWidth = 0.0 [ParameterName="Toon Terminator Width"; Group="31 - Feature: Default"; SortPriority=1; SliderMin=0; SliderMax=1; Description="每材质的明暗交界宽度, 与逐光源的 ToonLightSmooth 解耦 —— 同一盏灯下皮肤软、布料硬. 0 = 完全交给 Ramp. 取值 0~1, 默认 0.0.\r\nPer-material terminator width, independent of the per-light ToonLightSmooth: soft skin and hard cloth under one light. 0 leaves it to the ramp. Range 0 to 1, default 0.0."];
		ScalarParameter In_Default_BloomWeight = 0.0 [ParameterName="Toon Bloom Weight"; Group="31 - Feature: Default"; SortPriority=2; SliderMin=0; SliderMax=1; Description="该材质的 Bloom 权重, 0 = 未授权(按 1.0 处理). 用来让眼睛发光而皮肤不泛光. 取值 0~1, 默认 0.0.\r\nThis material's bloom weight; 0 = unset (treated as 1.0). Lets eyes glow without the skin blooming. Range 0 to 1, default 0.0."];
